<section class="subset-lab" data-subset-lab aria-labelledby="subset-title">
  <header><div><span>STEP-THROUGH DEBUGGER</span><h3 id="subset-title">Follow the code as the recursion tree grows.</h3></div><p>Step through the optimal Java solution for <code>[1, 2, 3]</code>. The active source line, call stack, tree, and output stay synchronized.</p></header>
